  "subtitle": "Senegalese rice and fish",
  "excerpt": "Thieboudienne is the national dish of Senegal: fish stuffed with a herb paste and cooked with vegetables over tomato-stained rice. The dish is built in one pot and takes time but rewards patience. Serves 4.",
  "type": "RECIPE",
